WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.501
You cannot see your chart the way

2
00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.893
a colour blind reader does.

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.342
So the simulator renders those eyes,

4
00:00:06.342 --> 00:00:08.069
and the loop looks through them.

5
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.371
And none of it leaves your machine.
